,"assigneeName":string or null}]}',
25:   '',
26:   '- summary.keyPoints: the main topics and conclusions, one short sentence each.',
27:   '- summary.decisions: the decisions the participants agreed on; an empty array if there were none.',
28:   '- summary.nextSteps: what happens next (follow-ups, deadlines, upcoming meetings); an empty array if nothing 
was planned.',
29:   `- actionItems: concrete tasks someone committed to or was asked to do; at most 
${MEETING_NOTE_AI_DRAFT_MAX_ITEMS} items, each description at most 
${MEETING_NOTE_AI_DRAFT_MAX_DESCRIPTION.toLocaleString('en-US')} characters; an empty array if there were none.`,
