1: // Setup self-check of the meeting-notes fake AI server (T16): one scripted
2: // success per protocol endpoint (anthropic, openai, kimi, glm) over real HTTP,
3: // then the recorded request is read back. Any mismatch throws, failing the
4: // runner's setup loudly. Leaves the server reset.
